# season/stats/<season>/<week>.json -- trimmed Sleeper weekly usage lines.
# Written by python/sleepermetrics/nflstats.py on every successful live fetch;
# read back as the offline / cold-host fallback (same durable-JSON idea as
# season/adp/). One file per (season, week). This .gitkeep keeps the directory
# present before the first snapshot is committed.
